<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 91,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Monday 91,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Monday were 91,000 head, compared with 95,000 for the estimate, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade was not well established. Early sales Barrows and Gilts $0.50 higher than the midsession Monday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
