<p>few one interest     54.50  56.50	   55.50  57.50</p>
<p>Sows:  generally steady to 2.00 higher advance 500 up</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  43.00 -44.00	   43.00 -45.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   43.00 -45.50	   43.00 -46.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    45.00 -48.00	   45.00 -50.00</p>
